[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831998070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115731#issuecomment-3831998070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731","id":3831998070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kZ6Z2","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T20:52:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:24:56Z","body":"I'd say it's not really a bug..\nYou need to create separate Subsets of the Fonts for each language, and assign them individually.\n\nSo you can generate an English, Cyrillic or Devangari subset, with the exact characters the app is ever gonna need/use..\nDone right, this will increase performance a big deal. (and reduce size..)\n\nYou can also have a subset font for the Menus, and one subset font for the App/Game.. right?\n\n-The only problem is when you have mixed languages (like in a menu),\nand your prefered font doesnt include all the characters/symbols.\n\nThen Godot will request the missing characters/symbols to the OS (at least on Android or Linux), \nand they will appear on the screen, no problem.\n\nHowever this can cause an equally bigger performance hit,\nso it's good to make sure your base font includes all the characters you need.\n\nAnd at least make sure the fonts used in-game or in-app are complete.\n\nMenus can have a missing character no problem, (I guess)\nbut moving missing characters that need to be constantly fetched from the OS is not best practice so to speak.. ;)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831998070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832101893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115731#issuecomment-3832101893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731","id":3832101893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kaTwF","user":{"login":"FredJul","id":3428124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MjgxMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3428124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul","html_url":"https://github.com/FredJul","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T21:35:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T21:41:51Z","body":"Thank you for your answer.\n\nI though about using font subsets but some languages like simplified chinese still take a lot of place (for instance \"Noto Sans Simplified Chinese\" is 4MB and my problem would still exist with that subset). I guess it is somehow possible to strip the font and only keep the characters I really need, but it felt complicated.\n\nI was wondering if there was some possible engine optimization on this (like rasterizing only the displayed characters), but if it's not the case free free to close the ticket.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832101893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832128006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115731#issuecomment-3832128006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731","id":3832128006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kaaIG","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T21:55:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:40:29Z","body":"I dont know the exact number in Noto font, but..\nChinese language has like +60K characters? 10K for simplified..\n\nYou don't need all of them right?\n\nThen just take them out!\nthe font will reduce in Size (dramatically), and performance will increase..\n\nAsk Gemini how to do it, \nIn linux you can try pyftsubset, in win/mac there's surely other ways.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832128006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832141144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115731#issuecomment-3832141144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731","id":3832141144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kadVY","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T22:07:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:07:13Z","body":"> Godot seems to rasterize the entire font for this font size\n\nNo, only used characters are rasterized.\n\nYou can also select font sizes and characters to per rasterize in the font import settings (advanced i port settings).\n\nIf you are using a lot of font sizes, consider using MSDF font (in the i.port settings). It can be rescued for any size without re-rasterization (but you still want to select characters to pre-rasterize, since MSDF rasterization is slow).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832141144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832174765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115731#issuecomment-3832174765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731","id":3832174765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kalit","user":{"login":"FredJul","id":3428124,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MjgxMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3428124?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul","html_url":"https://github.com/FredJul","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FredJul/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T22:30:35Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:36:10Z","body":"Since only used characters are rasterized, I wondered why it was so slow with that specific font and I simply tried using a TTF format instead of WOFF2 one. To my surprise, the performance was back to normal!\n\n- With 8MB WOFF2 font, FPS goes from 120 to 8\n- With the same font as TTF (27MB), FPS stays at 120\n\nSo my issue actually came from that font format, it is certainly compressed and causes performances issues. I initially took a WOFF2 font to have a smaller game size.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832174765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]